fihrist:manuscript_1943 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Oo. 6.17" ;
    dct:description """The first part of the history of the life and reign of ʻAbbās I,
                        Shah of Iran, 1571-1629 , composed in 1025 / 1616 by Iskandar known as Munshī.
                     With an introduction treating of his predecessors.Ṣaḥīfā II and Maqṣad II are
                     missing in this volume but together with Oo.6.16 and Add.201 these three independant volumes make up a complete copy of
                     the work.""" ;
