fihrist:manuscript_9639 a mdhn:Manuscript ;
    rdfs:label "Qq. 211" ;
    dct:date "1047",
        "1056",
        "1636",
        "1646" ;
    dct:description "The manuscript comprises eight separate treatises. The first is a commentary of al-Qaṣīdah al-munfarijah , القصيدة المنفرجة of Ibn al-Naḥwī, Yūsuf ibn Muḥammad , ابن النحوي، يوسف بن محمد . The fourth treatise is a commentary of the Lāmīyat al-ʻAjam , لامية العجم of al-Ṭughrāʾī, al-Ḥusayn ibn ʻAlī, 1061 or 2-1121? , الطغرائي، الحسين بن علي The fifth treatise is the famous Ajurrūmīyah with the commentary of Burhān al-Dīn Abū Isḥāq Ibrāhīm al-Buḥayrī al-Mālikī al-Azharī , برهان الدين ابو اسحاق ابراهيم البحيري المالكي الازهري" ;
    dct:identifier "manuscript_9639" ;
    dct:language "ar",
        "fa" ;
